---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural News for Africa
description: Current agricultural news, farming developments, markets, policy and opportunities across Africa.
permalink: "/agricultural-news/"
language: en
pageLanguage: en
pageSection: agricultural-news
---
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
<div class="container">
<h1>Agricultural Current News</h1>
<p class="lede">Follow current agricultural developments across all 54 African countries. News will be published only after verification from official or authoritative sources.</p>

{% set latestShown = 0 %}
{% for country in agriculturalNews.countries %}
  {% if country.articles and country.articles.length and latestShown < 6 %}
    {% set latestShown = latestShown + 1 %}
    {% set article = country.articles[0] %}
    <article class="card" style="margin:18px 0;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>{{ country.flag }} {{ country.name }}</strong> · {{ article.category | replace("-", " ") }}</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem;margin:0 0 8px;">{{ article.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ article.summary }}</p>
      <p style="font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:0;">{{ article.source }} · Verified {{ article.verified }}</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;"><a href="{{ article.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read original source →</a></p>
    </article>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<h2 style="margin-top:40px;">54 African Country News Directories</h2>
<p>Select a country to see its verified agricultural news and developments.</p>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;">
{% for country in agriculturalNews.countries %}
<a class="card" href="/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/" style="text-decoration:none;">
<h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">{{ country.flag }} {{ country.name }}</h2>
<p>View current agricultural news for this country →</p>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
</section>
